@startuml
!include ../../../../../../tooling/styles/plantuml/interaction/sequence-diagram-style.iuml
title pr merge governance sequence (proposed; not deployed)
actor Developer
participant "GitHub PR" as PR
participant "CodeQL / checks" as C
participant "Ruleset / review protection" as G
participant "Read-only blocker analyst" as A
actor AppSec
Developer -> PR : open/update commit
PR -> C : trigger analysis
C -> G : analysis state and alerts
A -> PR : GET head, reviews and checks
A -> G : read ruleset signals
A -> AppSec : categorized blocker + evidence
note over G : final merge eligibility is a GitHub decision
AppSec --> Developer : fix, review, or valid exception route
@enduml
